# 🧠 Simple Mental Model

Imagine a classroom.

```text
CLASSROOM
Group = students
SGID = ON
```

Alice enters the classroom and creates:

```text
notes.txt
```

Bob enters and creates:

```text
homework.txt
```

Because SGID is enabled on the directory:

```text
Classroom
   │
   ├── notes.txt
   │     ↓
   │   group = students
   │
   └── homework.txt
         ↓
       group = students
```

So SGID on a directory basically says:

> **"Everything created inside me should inherit my group."**

